# Patterns excluded when this chart is loaded/packaged.
#
# DELIBERATELY MINIMAL. holdout/ and scripts/ are NOT listed: they are read at
# render time by .Files.Get (templates/50-holdout-configmap.yaml and
# templates/51-scripts-configmap.yaml) to build the evaluate.js / merge.js /
# iterate.js / status.js / comment.js ConfigMaps. Ignoring either would make those
# ConfigMaps render EMPTY — the holdout gate and the merge step would then fail at
# runtime with no render-time error. Only add patterns here after checking them
# against `grep -rn 'Files.Get' templates/`.
.git/
.gitignore
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.bak
*.orig
*~
*.tgz

# Terraform working files — iam/securityagent.tf is committed as code, but the
# provider plugins, state, and lock are NOT chart content (and state may hold secrets).
iam/.terraform
iam/.terraform.lock.hcl
iam/terraform.tfstate
iam/terraform.tfstate.backup
iam/_provider.tf
*.zip
